SUMMARY:Ontelaunee to Reading Potpourri Hike
DESCRIPTION:Metrotrails: NJ\, PA\, NY Metropolitan Area Hiking and More!\n
 Join us for this very interesting point to point hike between Ontelauee La
 ke and Reading.\nI've selected another Pennsylvania hike instead of shifti
 ng areas this time because there may be structures demolished soon that we
  need to see before it happens.\nAfter meeting in Reading at the Dollar Ge
 neral\, we will shuttle with as few vehicles as possible to our start poin
 t.\nThere are several trails\, and some abandoned roads along the lake. So
 me of it is an abandoned former road that had been used prior to the creat
 ion of the lake.\nWe'll weave around on the trail system in an indirect ro
 ute\, and then make our way onto some back roads\, through school ball fie
 lds\, and then south onto a closed road and past an historic bridge.\nWe w
 ill continued from here along a few more back roads to the Muhlenberg Rail
  Trail. We'll take that south just about to our end point.\nDistance will 
 be about sixteen miles.\nIf needed\, contact me at 908 343 8374
